    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσονομ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call by a name</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὺς π.
				σφεας ἀπὸ . . </span><i>give</i> them <i>the name</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.52
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθέρα π. τὸν ἀνωτάτω τόπον</span>”
