			</span></i> (Canopus, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				90.39
			</span></i>(Rosetta, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>, both 
				Pass.
			); 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτονομάζω</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άζοντας Ἀλκεσίππεια</span>
			<i>calling</i> the games <i><span class="en">A.,
					<u>SIG</u>631.5</span></i>
			(Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>):—
				Aeol.
			
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργέταν</span></div>
